# {{ .ProviderShortName }} Provider

The Umami provider manages websites and teams in [Umami](https://umami.is/), self-hosted or Umami Cloud.

## Authentication

Use an API key (Umami v3.4.0+ or Umami Cloud), created under Settings → API keys. On older self-hosted instances, use the username and password of a user without two-factor authentication. Use a dedicated non-admin user: admin credentials can read and delete every website on the instance.

